{"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNVectorStyleLayer\/predicate","interfaceLanguage":"occ"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The style layer’s predicate."}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"],"tokens":[{"text":"@property","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" (","kind":"text"},{"text":"nonatomic","kind":"keyword"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"c:objc(cs)NSPredicate","text":"NSPredicate","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" * ","kind":"text"},{"text":"predicate","kind":"identifier"},{"text":";","kind":"text"}],"languages":["occ"]}]},{"content":[{"anchor":"discussion","text":"Discussion","type":"heading","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Use the style layer’s predicate to include only the features in the source","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"layer that satisfy a condition that you define. If the style layer initially","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"comes from the style, its predicate corresponds to the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"filter"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"property in the style JSON.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"See the “"},{"type":"text","text":"Predicates and Expressions"},{"type":"text","text":"”"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"guide for details about the predicate syntax supported by this class."}]},{"anchor":"Example","text":"Example","type":"heading","level":3},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"To filter the layer to include only the features whose ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"index"},{"text":" attribute is 5","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"or 10 and whose ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ele"},{"text":" attribute is at least 1,500, you could create an","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":